      'Day 7 — Slow down. A final beach morning, some shopping, and a last good dinner. If you are travelling as a group or celebrating, finish on a high — our <a href="/en/stag-hen-party-tenerife">group celebrations</a> set-ups (prosecco, matching tees, a leaderboard) make the last night the one everyone remembers. One week, the whole island.',
